d=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tThese creatures can only harm you in close combat, so maintain your distance unless you're a <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">\nknight</a>. If you plan to hunt them, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarven%20Ring\">Dwarven Ring</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarven%20Ring\"><img alt=\"Dwarven Ring\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dwarven_Ring_67bdd7.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> can help you avoid Drunkenness.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 2,434 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td><i>Empty</i></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.63</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"63.393591\" style=\"text-align:center;\">63%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Raw%20Meat\"><img alt=\"Raw Meat\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Raw_Meat_9b6e19.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Raw%20Meat\">Raw Meat</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Check Mark\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Check_Mark_b3619b.gif\" width=\"12\"/></span></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.18</td>\n<td class=\"